WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
New roots this week.

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.130
One means push.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:04.730
One means hold.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:09.880
Think of a printing press pushing ink onto paper, or a jar that holds jam.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.700
Every word in the quilt is pushing something or holding something.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.650
Ask which one, then sew.
